      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As with previous features (remember when there were complaints in late 2025 about the shop and avatars page defaulting to showing the store instead of your own avatars?), I think this is best to be solved by having the app remember previously chosen \"page\" (e.g. \"Group Activity\") on app restart.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
